      "degradation": {
        "review_status": "needs_review",
        "ownerApproved": false,
        "promotionAuthorized": false,
        "method": "Replace only four named complication and closing paragraphs with generic coaching and capacity abstractions. Leave heading, dates, attribution, structure, calculated facts, and every unnamed paragraph byte-identical.",
        "replacements": [
          {
            "paragraphIndex": 6,
            "sourceSha256": "2354d99335dcde8758c8add2c823c1d4bd31362078922580e809ee67863f06e5",
            "replacement": "The complication arrives between those eclipses. Jupiter squares your Moon on August 27, and expanding opportunities may ask you to honor your capacity. Messages, plans, and responsibilities can accumulate quickly, making balance and sustainable pacing more important."
          },
          {
            "paragraphIndex": 7,
            "sourceSha256": "62057f66898d62118915145cbd10f68eb4412408002f78de5975e187aecd01da",
            "replacement": "Because your Moon sits in the sixth house of work, health, and daily routines, the increased activity may affect your overall well-being and the balance of the week. You may need more support, more intentional routines, or a more sustainable relationship with productivity as professional demands grow."
          },
          {
            "paragraphIndex": 8,
            "sourceSha256": "c6da70afce6381792df51f6f3e121676ddf1ca5bb6a0278dfe40a97e7e1a4a57",
            "replacement": "This is where professional enthusiasm can benefit from greater awareness and discernment. A new project or useful meeting may still require meaningful time and energy. Let your opportunities grow in alignment with your capacity."
          },
          {
            "paragraphIndex": 9,
            "sourceSha256": "676f53e0b364c546a55c5269df5b5120b18b03f409896bf346fb569fc70daa33",
            "replacement": "If professional growth repeatedly asks you to compromise your energy or well-being, the career plan may need more balance, support, and sustainable structure."
          }
        ]
      },
